<title>USA: Central Hudson to buy back 14 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>Central Hudson to buy back 14 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>POUGHKEEPSIE, N.Y. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Hudson Gas &amp; Electric Corp said Friday it plans to buy back up to 2.5 million shares, or 14 percent of its outstanding shares, over a three-year period.</p>
<p>The target level for 1997 is 250,000 shares, it said. The future target amounts will be set on a year-by-year basis, it said.</p>
</text>
